.TH std::mdspan::extent 3 "2026.11.10" "http://cppreference.com" "C++ Standard Libary"
.SH NAME
std::mdspan::extent \- std::mdspan::extent

.SH Synopsis
constexpr index_type extent( rank_type r ) const noexcept;  (since C++23)

Returns the extent of a mdspan at the rank index r. Equivalent to return
extents().extent(r);.

.SH Parameters

r - The rank index to get the extent size of

.SH Return value

The extent at the given rank index.

